ok like nose in front of body, but since saddle nose points forward and body sits behind, in side view the nose can be in front of the body silhouette? The body might occlude; physically the saddle nose is under body, not in front. Avoid.\n\nNo need to prove saddle if pelican sits there; title and overall pose show it.\n\nBike position and body relationship: with body bottom 352 and saddle y=350, the pelican appears to sit right on it.\n\nNeed maybe add visible seatpost and saddle under body sides. Fine.\n\nWing path adjust to body (new bottom): shoulder around (475,275). Handlebar grip at (677,336). Good.\n\nLet's settle exact coordinates:\n\nBike:\nR=(320,520), F=(698,520), BB=(505,527), S=(418,362), HT=(627,348), HB=(654,411).\nSaddle: path center at 420, top 349, bottom 361; seat post S -> (418,354) maybe.\nActually S=(418,362) is seat cluster. Seatpost from (418,362) to (416,353). Saddle path at y=344-357. Pelican body bottom ~352. Fine.\n\nHandlebar grip at (678,330). Wing tip to (678,334).\nStem (627,348)->(633,320). Bar path from (633,320) C(640,305)(665,303)(679,315) C(688,322)(686,331)(678,335). Grip maybe stroke #E46650 from (670,327) to (686,336)? Hard. Add a grip as thick line segment near end `M 670 327 C 677 330 682 334 681 338` stroke coral width 9. Wing covers parts.\nMaybe handlebar bar as silver with black outline. Add bell at (644,309) small gold circle with clapper.\n\nBike layers:\n- wheels\n- chain\n- far crank\n- far leg\n- frame\n- near crank\n- near leg\n- pelican body/head\n- wing\n- maybe near foot? Already in near crank. But body drawn after may not cover foot. no.\nGiven body after near leg, body bottom 352, doesn't affect.\n- scarf details.\n- foreground.\n\nCould add a small wicker basket over front wheel? Not.\n\nNeed motion in wings? Body bob. Scarf flutter. Good.\n\nLet's start writing. Ensure all values. Might be long ~600 lines. That's okay. We'll use write. Needmaybe first generate a draft then render.\n\nLet me draft SVG fully.\n\nImportant: HTML color maybe. Use style attributes. Use no CSS except maybe `style`? SMIL.\n\nDefs:\n```\n<radialGradient id=\"sunGlow\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"50%\">\n <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFE4A3\" stop-opacity=\".7\"/>\n <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#FFE4A3\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/>\n</radialGradient>\n```\nCloud shapes use fill #FFF8EC opacity .78. Maybe one large.\n\nTextures: Add subtle noise? no.\n\nDeck clip path `<clipPath id=\"deckClip\"><rect x=\"0\" y=\"616\" width=\"1000\" height=\"84\"/></clipPath>`.\n\nDrop shadow filter:\n```\n<filter id=\"bikeShadow\" x=\"-20%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"140%\" height=\"140%\">\n  <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\"/>\n</filter>\n```\nFor flat shadow ellipse.\n\nFrame shadow filter maybe. Could skip.\n\nWheel group IDs.\n\nLet's compute spokes 12. Write lines with transforms: 0,30,60,90,120,150. Since a line through center covers opposite, 6 lines gives 12 spokes. Use 6 lines each from y=-89 to y=89? A single line through center is 2 spokes. 6 lines at 0,30,60,90,120,150 = 12 spokes. Good.\n```\n<g stroke=\"#F2DFC0\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\".9\">\n <line y1=\"-88\" y2=\"88\"/> ...\n</g>\n```\nAt rotate 0 vertical. fine.\nAdd 2 crossing short lines? no.\n\nWheel tire:\n```\n<circle r=\"104\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1D292E\" stroke-width=\"14\"/>\n<circle r=\"103\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#3A4A50\" stroke-width=\"5\"/>\n<circle r=\"92\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E9B45D\" stroke-width=\"6\"/>\n<circle r=\"87\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F8E5BF\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" opacity=\".8\"/>\n```\nMaybe a subtle green/cream stripe on tire? no.\n\nValve: `<g transform=\"translate(0,-97)\"><rect x=\"-3\" y=\"0\" width=\"6\" height=\"11\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#E2604B\"/></g>` at t=0 top. Good.\n\nReflector: `<circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"66\" r=\"4\" fill=\"#FFD37A\"/>` rotates.\n\nHub:\n`<circle r=\"12\" fill=\"#D8A85c\" stroke=\"#7A4A28\" stroke-width=\"2\"/><circle r=\"5\" fill=\"#203136\"/>`.\n\nFrame:\nUse both dark and inner. Need path. Could use `<path d=\"...\">`.\nDraw frame shadows first:\n```\n<g fill=none stroke-linecap=round stroke-linejoin=round>\n <path d=... stroke=\"#0D3C44\" stroke-width=\"16\"/>\n <path d=... stroke=\"#226F78\" stroke-width=\"11\"/>\n <path d=\"M418 362 L627 348 M505 527 L654 411 M654 411 C... \" stroke=\"#3E9A9F\" stroke-width=\"3\" opacity=\".6\"/>\n</g>\n```\nHighlight only top tube and fork maybe.\n\nFrame d path: \n`M320 520 L505 527 L698 520 M320 520 L418 362 M505 527 L418 362 M418 362 L627 348 M505 527 L654 411 M627 348 L654 411 M654 411 C662 450 680 492 698 520`\nThis single path includes no M between continuous lines? We need `M` before each segment; first `M320 520 L505 527 L698 520` creates chainstay then front? Wait that connects BB to front hub directly—not desired. Need:\n`M320 520 L505 527` chainstay\n`M418 362 L320 520` seatstay\n`M505 527 L418 362` seat tube\n`M418 362 L627 348` top tube\n`M505 527 L654 411` down tube\n`M627 348 L654 411` head tube\n`M654 411 C663 452 680 491 698 520` fork\nSo path d can include M segments. Good.\n- Chainstay could be two lines? no.\n\nDropouts at hubs: circles r=8 dark/center.\nFork crown: small line/rect at (654,411).\n- Brake caliper on front fork: neat detail near (676,472) small dark shape and cable. Could add. Perhaps not.\n\nSeatpost: `<line x1=418 y1=362 x2=415 y2=352 stroke=#203136 width=10/><line ... silver width=6/>`.\nSaddle path:\n`M 379 353 C 386 345 408 343 431 345 C 448 347 462 344 474 348 C 468 355 450 359 428 359 C 406 359 388 358 379 353 Z` fill leather, stroke dark 2. Add highlight at top.\nBody covers center.\n\nHandlebar:\n- stem silver with dark outline.\n- bar path.\n- grip coral.\n\nBell:\n`<circle cx=643 cy=311 r=8 fill=#F0C25A stroke=#8D5D2C width=2/>` maybe with lever.\nCould be partially behind wing. Fine.\n\nChain:\nPath as above. Use `M505 496 L320 507 A13 13 0 0 0 320 533 L505 558` but arc direction from top rear to bottom rear. The tangent points maybe not exact. Add close? If not closed, chainring covers ends. Add animate dashoffset from 0 to -20 dur=.45s. Stroke width 4, dasharray 4 3. Draw two parallel? chain links. Could draw stroke #7B898B width 5 and inner dashed #D9D4C4 width 2 for detail. Nice:\n```\n<path d=... fill=none stroke=#6E7C7E stroke-width=5/>\n<path ... stroke=#D7D8C9 stroke-width=2 stroke-dasharray=\"3 5\"><animate.../></path>\n```\nChainring covers ends.\n\nFar crank group:\n```\n<g transform=\"translate(505 527)\">\n <g>\n  <animateTransform .../>\n  <line x1=0 y1=0 x2=0 y2=-38 st","truncated":true}
{"type":"tool_call","callId":"call_00_NaQYsO9YsLfmeZOtVPXC4577","tool":"write","input":{"file_path":"/tmp/vellery-_k8atuzc/work/pelican.svg","content":"<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"UTF-8\"?>\n<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 700\" width=\"1000\" height=\"700\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"title desc\">\n  <title id=\"title\">Pelican Riding a Bicycle</title>\n  <desc id=\"desc\">A cheerful white pelican in a red scarf pedals a teal bicycle along a sunny seaside boardwalk, with spinning wheels, turning cranks and fluttering scarf.</desc>\n\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"skyGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#F8EBD8\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.52\" stop-color=\"#F9DCC0\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#CDE8E1\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <radialGradient id=\"sunGrad\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"50%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFF6CE\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.62\" stop-color=\"#FFD889\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#F8BE64\"/>\n    </radialGradient>\n    <radialGradient id=\"sunHalo\" cx=\"50%\" cy=\"50%\" r=\"50%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFE3A3\" stop-opacity=\"0.65\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.55\" stop-color=\"#FFE3A3\" stop-opacity=\"0.24\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#FFE3A3\" stop-opacity=\"0\"/>\n    </radialGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"seaGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#8BCBC5\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.46\" stop-color=\"#57A5AA\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#377D8D\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"sandGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#F4DDAD\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#DFB47B\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"deckGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#E4B77D\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.55\" stop-color=\"#D2A064\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#B77E4C\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"bodyGrad\" x1=\"0.2\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0.4\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFFEF9\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.68\" stop-color=\"#FAF3E5\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#EADCC7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"wingGrad\" x1=\"0.1\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0.3\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFFEF9\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.7\" stop-color=\"#F7EFDF\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#E5D8C4\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"beakGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0.75\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#F8C76A\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.55\" stop-color=\"#F1AB42\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#D9852D\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"pouchGrad\" x1=\"0.1\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0.15\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#F9CF82\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.62\" stop-color=\"#F3B663\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#E89355\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <linearGradient id=\"scarfGrad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"0.3\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#DA5149\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#EB7460\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n    <radialGradient id=\"eyeGrad\" cx=\"42%\" cy=\"38%\" r=\"65%\">\n      <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#FFE28A\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"0.58\" stop-color=\"#F4B94B\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#C9852E\"/>\n    </radialGradient>\n    <filter id=\"blurSoft\" x=\"-30%\" y=\"-100%\" width=\"160%\" height=\"300%\">\n      <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"6\"/>\n    </filter>\n    <filter id=\"cloudBlur\" x=\"-30%\" y=\"-40%\" width=\"160%\" height=\"180%\">\n      <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"1.3\"/>\n    </filter>\n    <filter id=\"glowBlur\" x=\"-50%\" y=\"-50%\" width=\"200%\" height=\"200%\">\n      <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"10\"/>\n    </filter>\n    <clipPath id=\"deckClip\">\n      <rect x=\"0\" y=\"616\" width=\"1000\" height=\"84\"/>\n    </clipPath>\n    <clipPath id=\"sceneClip\">\n      <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"700\"/>\n    </clipPath>\n  </defs>\n\n  <g clip-path=\"url(#sceneClip)\">\n    <!-- sky -->\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"372\" fill=\"url(#skyGrad)\"/>\n\n    <!-- sun -->\n    <circle cx=\"832\" cy=\"112\" r=\"126\" fill=\"url(#sunHalo)\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"832\" cy=\"112\" r=\"66\" fill=\"#FFE5A6\" opacity=\"0.35\" filter=\"url(#glowBlur)\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"832\" cy=\"112\" r=\"54\" fill=\"url(#sunGrad)\"/>\n    <circle cx=\"815\" cy=\"96\" r=\"14\" fill=\"#FFF7DC\" opacity=\"0.45\"/>\n\n    <!-- drifting clouds -->\n    <g fill=\"#FFF9EE\" opacity=\"0.78\" filter=\"url(#cloudBlur)\">\n      <g>\n        <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" attributeType=\"XML\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0;22 0;0 0\" dur=\"26s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n        <path d=\"M70 128 C68 111 83 100 100 104 C107 85 132 77 150 91 C162 79 185 84 191 101 C211 99 224 113 217 126 C212 136 196 139 176 137 L83 137 C73 136 69 133 70 128 Z\"/>\n        <path d=\"M538 90 C537 78 548 70 560 73 C566 59 584 55 596 66 C606 57 623 63 626 77 C641 76 650 87 645 97 C640 105 626 107 612 105 L549 105 C541 104 537 99 538 90 Z\" opacity=\"0.86\"/>\n        <path d=\"M322 179 C321 170 329 164 338 166 C343 155 357 152 366 161 C374 155 386 159 389 170 C399 170 405 178 401 185 C398 191 388 193 378 191 L331 191 C325 190 321 186 322 179 Z\" opacity=\"0.55\"/>\n      </g>\n    </g>\n\n    <!-- gulls -->\n    <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#63888B\" stroke-width=\"2.4\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.8\">\n      <path d=\"M258 146 C266 139 273 139 280 146\"/>\n      <path d=\"M278 147 C285 141 291 141 297 147\"/>\n      <path d=\"M342 122 C349 116 355 116 361 122\"/>\n      <path d=\"M359 123 C365 118 371 118 376 123\"/>\n    </g>\n\n    <!-- sea -->\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"360\" width=\"1000\" height=\"180\" fill=\"url(#seaGrad)\"/>\n    <rect x=\"0\" y=\"359\" width=\"1000\" height=\"4\" fill=\"#E9F5E8\" opacity=\"0.68\"/>\n    <path d=\"M0 400 C58 386 115 389 176 402 C231 414 277 413 330 401 C390 387 448 388 505 402 C567 417 621 416 682 402 C742 389 800 390 858 402 C910 413 960 413 1000 403 L1000 372 L0 372 Z\" fill=\"#B9E1D9\" opacity=\"0.18\"/>\n\n    <!-- distant headland -->\n    <path d=\"M0 365 C32 347 68 344 98 356 C120 365 148 359 176 348 C205 337 238 347 248 366 L248 386 L0 386 Z\" fill=\"#4F8B8B\" opacity=\"0.55\"/>\n    <path d=\"M0 372 C36 362 62 363 92 373 C125 384 162 378 200 369 L200 388 L0 388 Z\" fill=\"#3F747C\" opacity=\"0.45\"/>\n\n    <!-- far sailboat -->\n    <g>\n      <animateTransform attributeName=\"transform\" attributeType=\"XML\" type=\"translate\" values=\"0 0;0 3;0 0\" dur=\"6.5s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n      <path d=\"M137 441 L179 441 L171 451 L146 451 Z\" fill=\"#6A4B3A\"/>\n      <path d=\"M157 378 L157 441\" stroke=\"#6F573F\" stroke-width=\"2.5\"/>\n      <path d=\"M158 383 C169 396 176 411 178 432 L160 432 Z\" fill=\"#FFF7E6\" opacity=\"0.94\"/>\n      <path d=\"M155 390 C144 402 139 416 139 431 L155 431 Z\" fill=\"#F7EAD1\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n      <path d=\"M132 448 C150 453 171 453 187 447\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#E6F6EF\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.65\"/>\n    </g>\n\n    <!-- sea shimmer -->\n    <g fill=\"none\" stroke-linecap=\"round\">\n      <path d=\"M-30 418 C24 411 72 423 125 416 C178 409 224 421 277 415 C330 409 376 420 429 415 C482 410 528 420 581 415 C634 410 680 421 733 415 C786 409 832 420 885 415 C938 410 988 420 1035 415\" stroke=\"#DDF4ED\" stroke-width=\"2.6\" opacity=\"0.42\" stroke-dasharray=\"44 30\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"0\" to=\"-148\" dur=\"7s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n      </path>\n      <path d=\"M-10 466 C42 460 84 469 132 464 C180 459 220 468 268 463 C316 458 358 468 406 463 C454 458 496 468 544 463 C592 458 634 468 682 463 C730 458 772 468 820 463 C868 458 910 468 958 463 C990 460 1015 463 1040 465\" stroke=\"#C8EEE6\" stroke-width=\"2.2\" opacity=\"0.3\" stroke-dasharray=\"30 40\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"0\" to=\"-140\" dur=\"9s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n      </path>\n      <path d=\"M-20 504 C35 498 90 507 145 502 C200 497 255 506 310 502 C365 498 420 507 475 502 C530 497 585 507 640 502 C695 497 750 507 805 502 C860 497 915 507 970 502 C1000 499 1020 501 1040 503\" stroke=\"#E8F8F1\" stroke-width=\"2\" opacity=\"0.25\" stroke-dasharray=\"22 48\">\n        <animate attributeName=\"stroke-dashoffset\" from=\"0\" to=\"-130\" dur=\"11s\" repeatCount=\"indefinite\"/>\n      </path>\n    </g>\n    <g fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#F4FBF4\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" opacity=\"0.55\">\n      <path d=\"M226 479 C240 474 254 476 264 483\"/>\n      <path d=\"M676 445 C690 440 704 443 712 450\"/>\n      <path d=\"M416 518 C430 513 444 515 454 522\"/>\n    </g>\n\n    <!-- beach -->\n    <path d=\"M0 523 C111 515 "},"truncated":true}
